First release.

Watches your Starlink dish over its local Wi-Fi connection and sounds a loud alarm if it is moved or unplugged.

- Triggers on orientation change, GPS movement, or loss of contact with the dish
- Plays on the alarm stream, so silent mode does not mute it
- Home-screen widget to arm, disarm and silence
- Pick your own alarm sound
- Optional webhook when an alarm fires
- Event log of what tripped it and when
